---
<header>
<p class="eyebrow">Free Basketball Performance Tool</p>
<h1>Can I<span>Dunk?</span></h1>
<p class="hero-sub">Enter your height and vertical jump to find out instantly — and if not, exactly how close you are and what it will take.</p>
</header><div class="container">
<div class="links-row">
<a class="site-link" href="/vertical-jump-percentile">
      ↑ <strong>Vertical Jump</strong> Percentile Calculator
    </a>
<a class="site-link" href="/squat-strength-calculator">
      ↑ <strong>Squat Strength</strong> Predictor
    </a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<p class="card-label">Your Measurements</p>
<div class="form-grid">
<div class="field">
<label for="height-ft">Height</label>
<div style="display:flex;gap:0.5rem">
<input id="height-ft" max="8" min="4" placeholder="Ft" step="1" style="flex:1" type="number"/>
<input id="height-in" max="11" min="0" placeholder="In" step="1" style="flex:1" type="number"/>
</div>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label>Units</label>
<div class="unit-toggle">
<button class="unit-btn active" onclick="setUnit('imperial', this)">FT / IN</button>
<button class="unit-btn" onclick="setUnit('metric', this)">CM</button>
</div>
</div>
<div class="field full" id="input-imperial">
<label for="vertical-in">Vertical Jump (inches) — leave blank if unknown</label>
<input id="vertical-in" max="60" min="0" placeholder="e.g. 24" step="0.5" type="number"/>
</div>
<div class="field full" id="input-metric" style="display:none">
<label for="height-cm">Height (cm)</label>
<input id="height-cm" max="250" min="120" placeholder="e.g. 183" step="1" type="number"/>
<label for="vertical-cm" style="margin-top:0.75rem">Vertical Jump (cm) — leave blank if unknown</label>
<input id="vertical-cm" max="150" min="0" placeholder="e.g. 61" step="1" style="margin-top:0.4rem" type="number"/>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="wingspan">Wingspan Relative to Height</label>
<select id="wingspan">
<option value="short">Short arms (wingspan &lt; height)</option>
<option selected="" value="average">Average (wingspan ≈ height)</option>
<option value="long">Long arms (wingspan &gt; height by 2"+)</option>
<option value="very-long">Very long (wingspan &gt; height by 4"+)</option>
</select>
</div>
<div class="field">
<label for="takeoff">Preferred Takeoff</label>
<select id="takeoff">
<option selected="" value="two">Two feet (standing / power dunk)</option>
<option value="one">One foot (running / approach dunk)</option>
</select>
</div>
</div>
<button class="calc-btn" onclick="calculate()">Can I Dunk? →</button>
</div>

